OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after boy hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the car, a man in his
OL,7,F60s, was arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fpossessing a Class A drug, Greater
OL,9,FManchester Police said.
